.TH MOXY 1 "" "moxy"
.SH NAME
moxy \- MCP proxy that aggregates child MCP servers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moxy
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Moxy spawns child MCP servers as subprocesses, communicates with them via JSON-RPC over stdio, and presents their tools, resources, and prompts through a single unified MCP server. Child server capabilities are namespaced with a dot separator (e.g. grit.status, folio.read). Configuration is loaded from a hierarchy of TOML moxyfiles: global (~/.config/moxy/moxyfile), per-directory, and project-local.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR add (1)
Interactively add a server to a moxyfile
.TP
.BR check-moxins (1)
Check that a directory of moxins loads, listing every failure
.TP
.BR install-claude-plugin (1)
Install the moxy Claude Code plugin via claude CLI
.TP
.BR list-moxins (1)
List available builtin moxins
.TP
.BR moxin-path (1)
Print default MOXIN_PATH from legacy hierarchy
.TP
.BR narrows (1)
Check that a child moxyfile grants no more than a parent
.TP
.BR perms-matrix (1)
Print the moxin tool permissions matrix as markdown
.TP
.BR render (1)
Render or reverse-resolve a namespaced tool/prompt name under a template
.TP
.BR serve-http (1)
Run as MCP proxy server over streamable HTTP
.TP
.BR serve-mcp (1)
Run as MCP proxy server over stdio
.TP
.BR serve-moxin (1)
Serve a single builtin moxin as a standalone MCP server
.TP
.BR show-claude-plugin-path (1)
Print the path to the Claude Code plugin directory
.TP
.BR show-effective-moxyfile (1)
Print the effective merged moxyfile as canonical TOML
.TP
.BR status (1)
Show all configured servers and moxins with their sources
.TP
.BR version (1)
Print moxy build version and any build-time-pinned tools
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Start the MCP proxy server
.nf
$ moxy serve mcp
.fi
.TP
Show config hierarchy, moxins, and validation
.nf
$ moxy status
.fi
.TP
Interactively add a server to the local moxyfile
.nf
$ moxy add
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR moxy-add (1),
.BR moxy-check-moxins (1),
.BR moxy-install-claude-plugin (1),
.BR moxy-list-moxins (1),
.BR moxy-moxin-path (1),
.BR moxy-narrows (1),
.BR moxy-perms-matrix (1),
.BR moxy-render (1),
.BR moxy-serve-http (1),
.BR moxy-serve-mcp (1),
.BR moxy-serve-moxin (1),
.BR moxy-show-claude-plugin-path (1),
.BR moxy-show-effective-moxyfile (1),
.BR moxy-status (1),
.BR moxy-version (1)
